@title EMC fix-it: ask for a hard distance between two wires' ducts, preview and apply
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The fixture states 100 mm for a motor wire beside an analog wire and has two ducts 140 mm apart. EMC-01 offers "Preview: Route the two wires in ducts at least 100 mm apart". The preview re-routes a copy: EMC-01 goes. Apply is one undo step and says the cut length can change. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-keep-clear.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Preview: Route the two wires in ducts at least"
click_text "Preview: Route the two wires in ducts at least" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Clears EMC-01"
expect "edge to edge"
shot 01-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 15
expect "cut length"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 02-applied
check_layout
key Escape
wait 12
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key Home
wait 15
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
shot 03-plate-after
check_layout
